<title>LATVIA: STOCKS SLIDE FURTHER, RTF GAINS ON Q1.</title>
<headline>STOCKS SLIDE FURTHER, RTF GAINS ON Q1.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares maintained their recent</p>
<p>slide on the Riga stock exchange on Friday, with Unibanka down</p>
<p>two santimes to 3.45 lats.</p>
<p>Riga Transport Fleet rose to 1.29 lats from 1.23 lats. RTF</p>
<p>today said its first quarter profit together with subsidiaries</p>
<p>came to 1.17 million lats.</p>
<p>Latvian Bridges rose on good 1996 figures. It reported a</p>
<p>profit of 121,000 lats.</p>
